{"version":1,"content":"<p>央視調查發現，近年越來越多學生自媒體賬號背後暗藏MCN機構，硬性直播任務擠壓學業休息，還存在借騎手工服拍虛假苦情內容的情況。有機構以高額違約金要挾籤約學生，部分機構為追求話題熱度，引導學生擺拍、製造對立內容。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/movie/1586408.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T10:43:43.846257+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T10:27:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T10:36:56.002824+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T10:36:56.002824+00:00","content_hash":"436a2ae90cc3eadd6b09e7dd2f5edc8780f1bb2d1bc33e6d90aae35c749718ca","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}